# Component/data-flow view, not deployment containers or native qualification.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
*.style.font-size: 25
Start: "Start here\nOne application job" {class: start}
Snapshots: "Explicit preferences / indexed / running\nOne acquisition each"
Registration: "Once per seed ID\nCF list → AppKit list → preferred"
Slots: "Every raw slot before dedup\nType / bridge / count / projection"
Roots: "Two independent walks\nHeld first root → metadata → fresh identity"
Receipts: "Calls + cleanup + actual writes\nUnknown capacities stay symbolic"
Next: "k225: representations / scratch / wire\nWhole-job fit and native pending"
Start -> Snapshots: "1 · reserve possible cleanup first"
Snapshots -> Registration: "2 · coherent seeds + system reserves"
Registration -> Slots: "3 · no recursive expansion"
Slots -> Roots: "4 · each distinct spelling"
Roots -> Receipts: "5 · no refund or unknown-to-zero"
Receipts -> Next: "6 · retain k215 hold"
